\"consultation_extent\": \"Original NBER PDF title and abstract pages only (first two PDF pages); no references or related works followed.\", \"sha256\": \"387c5f99e6b6e99a210e83acbf8f4dd4351afafd6ae0c5fb7bd39e835c6b6fda\", \"original_document_path\": \"literature/Andrews2018Winners.pdf\", \"original_document_url\": \"https://www.nber.org/system/files/working_papers/w25456/w25456.pdf\"}\n{\"id\": \"ref.original.Berk2013PostSelection\", \"citation_key\": \"Berk2013PostSelection\", \"title\": \"Valid post-selection inference\", \"year\": 2013, \"source_url\": \"https://api.crossref.org/works/10.1214/12-AOS1077\", \"retrieved_at\": \"2026-11-06T05:38:00.312723+00:00\", \"consultation_path\": \"literature/Berk2013PostSelection.json\", \"consultation_extent\": \"Original abstract and metadata consulted; see saved abstract. No citation graph followed.\", \"sha256\": \"e10ad633abe7596a338f47659c32fd8ecf6bbe2fb4eb0c997d8e087d888ef15c\"}\n{\"id\": \"ref.original.Bates2021CrossValidation\", \"citation_key\": \"Bates2021CrossValidation\", \"title\": \"Cross-validation: what does it estimate and how well does it do it?\", \"year\": 2021, \"source_url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2104.00673\", \"retrieved_at\": \"2026-11-06T05:38:00.312991+00:00\", \"consultation_path\": \"literature/Bates2021CrossValidation.json\", \"consultation_extent\": \"Original abstract and metadata consulted; see saved abstract. No citation graph followed.\", \"sha256\": \"122f08331ecd4f2065ac5ebed3ac2c24a8a2984b57e39d8bd9ae0b3adc3c4b8e\"}\n{\"id\": \"ref.original.Brown2001Binomial\", \"citation_key\": \"Brown2001Binomial\", \"title\": \"Interval Estimation for a Binomial Proportion\", \"year\": 2001, \"source_url\": \"https://api.crossref.org/works/10.1214/ss/1009213286\", \"retrieved_at\": \"2026-11-06T05:38:00.313366+00:00\", \"consultation_path\": \"literature/Brown2001Binomial.json\", \"consultation_extent\": \"Original abstract and metadata consulted; see saved abstract. No citation graph followed.\", \"sha256\": \"c38e98e505a5172beb36c205bc7b553cc076cfb23c31bcdd17e26ce954b75d75\"}\n{\"id\": \"ref.original.Efron1979Bootstrap\", \"citation_key\": \"Efron1979Bootstrap\", \"title\": \"Bootstrap Methods: Another Look at the Jackknife\", \"year\": 1979, \"source_url\": \"https://api.crossref.org/works/10.1214/aos/1176344552\", \"retrieved_at\": \"2026-11-06T05:38:00.313695+00:00\", \"consultation_path\": \"literature/Efron1979Bootstrap.json\", \"consultation_extent\": \"Original abstract and metadata consulted; see saved abstract. No citation graph followed.\", \"sha256\": \"4ca5003c369d572d45c38ddda290387abeaaaedbf4ac6cd45083904cf771aa0c\"}\n{\"id\": \"ref.original.Stone1974CrossValidation\", \"citation_key\": \"Stone1974CrossValidation\", \"title\": \"Cross-Validatory Choice and Assessment of Statistical Predictions\", \"year\": 1974, \"source_url\": \"https://api.crossref.org/works/10.1111/j.2517-6161.1974.tb00994.x\", \"retrieved_at\": \"2026-11-06T05:38:00.314094+00:00\", \"consultation_path\": \"literature/Stone1974CrossValidation.json\", \"consultation_extent\": \"Original abstract and metadata consulted; see saved abstract. No citation graph followed.\", \"sha256\": \"1cda6b79353d8dbb421340f8999ec47b215e0c352fdf8b300a4365fa4453a24f\"}\n{\"id\": \"ref.original.Guyon2003Selection\", \"citation_key\": \"Guyon2003Selection\", \"title\": \"An Introduction to Variable and Feature Selection\", \"year\": 2003, \"source_url\": \"https://www.jmlr.org/papers/v3/guyon03a.html\", \"retrieved_at\": \"2026-11-06T05:38:00.314365+00:00\", \"consultation_path\": \"literature/Guyon2003Selection.json\", \"consultation_extent\": \"Original abstract and metadata consulted; see saved abstract. No citation graph followed.\", \"sha256\": \"0a824d5b5a2b91401cbdfeb526822c753542f0b457a486b346b972bb6d4fc484\"}\n{\"id\": \"ref.original.Varoquaux2018CrossValidation\", \"citation_key\": \"Varoquaux2018CrossValidation\", \"title\": \"Cross-validation failure: Small sample sizes lead to large error bars\", \"year\": 2018, \"source_url\": \"https://api.crossref.org/works/10.1016/j.neuroimage.2017.06.061\", \"retrieved_at\": \"2026-11-06T05:38:00.315417+00:00\", \"consultation_path\": \"literature/Varoquaux2018CrossValidation.json\", \"consultation_extent\": \"Original journal abstract as deposited in PubMed/Europe PMC, retrieved by exact DOI; metadata from Crossref. No citing or related pages followed.\", \"sha256\": \"94bdd85d1d5d89cc6e218982eec50729f7b784a23cbe32f0d7e09529fa6271c1\", \"abstract_source_url\": \"https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=DOI%3A10.1016%2Fj.neuroimage.2017.06.061&format=json&resultType=core\"}\n{\"id\": \"ref.original.Nadeau2003Inference\", \"citation_key\": \"Nadeau2003Inference\", \"title\": \"Inference for the Generalization Error\", \"year\": 2003, \"source_url\": \"https://api.crossref.org/works/10.1023/A:1024068626366\", \"retrieved_at\": \"2026-11-06T05:38:00.315912+00:00\", \"consultation_path\": \"literature/Nadeau2003Inference.json\", \"consultation_extent\": \"Original Springer abstract and metadata only; no references or recommendations followed.\", \"sha256\": \"028d6c5baae3d2906733e8ee76fa279b7f00cfba01bc8b7f28f71aa55619377d\"}\n{\"id\": \"ref.original.Benjamini1995\", \"citation_key\": \"Benjamini1995\", \"title\": \"Controlling the False Discovery Rate: A Practical and Powerful Approach to Multiple Testing\", \"year\": 1995, \"source_url\": \"https://api.crossref.org/works/10.1111/j.2517-6161.1995.tb02031.x\", \"retrieved_at\": \"2026-11-06T05:38:00.316316+00:00\", \"consultation_path\": \"literature/Benjamini1995.json\", \"consultation_extent\": \"Original abstract and metadata consulted; see saved abstract. No citation graph followed.\", \"sha256\": \"1d7dd8f5d16f61a9393dda4c6a1e9df9911942c452d61c9e3b7459ba8bb82c7c\"}\n{\"id\": \"ref.original.Varma2006Bias\", \"citation_key\": \"Varma2006Bias\", \"title\": \"Bias in error estimation when using cross-validation for model selection\", \"year\": 2006, \"source_url\": \"https://api.crossref.org/works/10.1186/1471-2105-7-91\", \"retrieved_at\": \"2026-11-06T05:38:00.316725+00:00\", \"consultation_path\": \"literature/Varma2006Bias.json\", \"consultation_extent\": \"Original abstract and metadata consulted; see saved abstract. No citation graph followed.\", \"sha256\": \"9feb5ccac8de85552bf7a3c0c36013a110ad6abbf08fec03291179d72faa2f31\"}\n{\"id\": \"ref.original.Ambroise2002Selection\", \"citation_key\": \"Ambroise2002Selection\", \"title\": \"Selection bias in gene extraction on the basis of microarray gene-expression data\", \"year\": 2002, \"source_url\": \"https://api.crossref.org/works/10.1073/pnas.102102699\", \"retrieved_at\": \"2026-11-06T05:38:00.317172+00:00\", \"consultation_path\": \"literature/Ambroise2002Selection.json\", \"consultation_extent\": \"Original abstract and metadata consulted; see saved abstract. No citation graph followed.\", \"sha256\": \"d53c1f29d5ece303986a1d481e5f00f55d756fce3e780da1d3ae06c9e2cf974d\"}\n{\"id\": \"ref.original.Arlot2010Survey\", \"citation_key\": \"Arlot2010Survey\", \"title\": \"A survey of cross-validation procedures for model selection\", \"year\": 2010, \"source_url\": \"https://api.crossref.org/works/10.1214/09-SS054\", \"retrieved_at\": \"2026-11-06T05:38:00.317878+00:00\", \"consultation_path\": \"literature/Arlot2010Survey.json\", \"consultation_extent\": \"Original abstract and metadata consulted; see saved abstract. No citation graph followed.\", \"sha256\": \"244bf3fc65627b6e608c403a507e3a7fcbc4ddef4f07c943bd01b5c3152f28ad\"}\n{\"id\": \"ref.original.Cawley2010Overfitting\", \"citation_key\": \"Cawley2010Overfitting\", \"title\": \"On Over-fitting in Model Selection and Subsequent Selection Bias in Performance Evaluation\", \"year\": 2010, \"source_url\": \"https://www.jmlr.org/papers/v11/cawley10a.html\", \"retrieved_at\": \"2026-11-06T05:38:00.318339+00:00\", \"consultation_path\": \"literature/Cawley2010Overfitting.json\", \"consultation_extent\": \"Original abstract and metadata consulted; see saved abstract. No citation graph followed.\", \"sha256\": \"5b67d8d866bea56eed2c1f4f51db1f9881e7a238dc64b0f59a7f5c94a3df86ae\"}\n{\"id\": \"ref.original.Bengio2004Variance\", \"citation_key\": \"Bengio2004Variance\", \"title\": \"No Unbiased Estimator of the Variance of K-Fold Cross-Validation\", \"year\": 2004, \"source_url\": \"https://www.jmlr.org/papers/v5/grandvalet04a.html\", \"retrieved_at\": \"2026-11-06T05:38:00.318533+00:00\", \"consultation_path\": \"literature/Bengio2004Variance.json\", \"consultation_extent\": \"Original abstract and metadata consulted; see saved abstract. No citation graph followed.\", \"sha256\": \"68830aa774fbf77914058514e80485ddcc22b2ed63299043b066f20aa13c8cf9\"}\n{\"id\": \"ref.original.DiCiccio1996Bootstrap\", \"citation_key\": \"DiCiccio1996Bootstrap\", \"title\": \"Bootstrap confidence intervals\", \"year\": 1996, \"source_url\": \"https://api.crossref.org/works/10.1214/ss/1032280214\", \"retrieved_at\": \"2026-11-06T05:38:00.318878+00:00\", \"consultation_path\": \"literature/DiCiccio1996Bootstrap.json\", \"consultation_extent\": \"Original abstract and metadata consulted; see saved abstract. No citation graph followed.\", \"sha256\": \"31ee47197c5b3325f189395a776d034dfc4025fc6968d75e9dada3ce913c5e98\"}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
